-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 24.11.2010 (הסתדרות המורים) — קיצור הדחייה של מועד
-- עדכון שכר: the parties agree that the deferral of 17.6.2009, carried out
-- to 31.10.2010, has exhausted the teachers' share in the crisis measures,
-- and bring its two moved dates forward. Whom it covers — every
-- teaching-scale employee of the State, and another public employer's who
-- joins (§2, worded as the deferral's §2); the last step of the 2008 wage
-- supplement of the agreement of 21.2.2008 (its §4(א)(3)) and the
-- completing update of the reform tables of the agreement of 25.12.2008
-- (its §35(ב)(1)), both as the deferral moved them to October 2011, brought
-- forward to November 2010 (§3(א)); §47 of 25.12.2008 converting again only
-- at §4(א)(1) and (2), with "another economic consideration" instead of the
-- third conversion (§3(ב)); exhaustion of claims (§4).
--
-- AN AMENDMENT ENCODES WHAT IT CHANGES AND IMPORTS THE REST: the deferral
-- of 17.6.2009 (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral.l4),
-- and through it the agreement of 21.2.2008 and §§35 and 47 of the base
-- agreement of 25.12.2008, are imported, and what this one moves is defined
-- here, dated, beside what it moves.
--
-- THE DAY OF SIGNING is written in by hand and the corpus reads it
-- `[לא קריא]` ("[לא קריא] לנובמבר 2010"); the corpus dates the agreement
-- 24.11.2010, the day the fax banner on both signed pages prints. The
-- agreement of 29.2.2012 (its §35) cites it as "29.11.10" (finding
-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-m there).
--
-- ITS ROUND is the 2009 crisis agreements, which the deferral's tests hold
-- it against; the shortened deferral is held against the 2008 frame and
-- against the deferral as signed, month by month, in
-- l4/tests/2010-11-24_teachers_wage-update-advancement-tests.l4, with the
-- takanon's §1.1ג note, which still says October 2011 (card
-- takanon-2008-advancement on the contradictions page).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT budget_foundations_law
IMPORT `2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — קיצור הדחייה של מועד עדכון שכר (הסתדרות המורים, 24.11.2010)`

DECLARE `2010 advancement action` IS ONE OF
    `join the 2010 advancement agreement by signing it`
    `tell the chief labour-relations officer in writing that it joins the 2010 advancement agreement`
    `negotiate further on a matter the 2010 advancement agreement settled`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp's heading, its year as the corpus marks it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The registration stamp: "this collective agreement was registered as by law"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The registration stamp's day, 18.11.2013; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The registration stamp's number, 214/2013, written by hand; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The registration stamp's signatory; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The registration stamp's signatory's office (the chief labour-relations officer); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The State and who represents it (the wages commissioner and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 הסתדרות המורים and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 A recital: the parties negotiated an amendment of the agreement of 17.6.09 in the light of the above.
-- akn:preamble/p18 A recital: the parties set the understandings down in this collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶8: made and signed on a day of November 2010 written in by hand, which
-- the corpus reads `[לא קריא]`. The month and the year are the page's; the
-- day the agreement is dated by is the corpus's, the fax banner's
-- (24.11.2010, on both signed pages).
@ref akn:preamble/p8
`the 2010 advancement agreement was signed in the month of` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010

`the 2010 advancement agreement's signed pages were faxed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 24 11 2010

`why the 2010 advancement agreement's day of signing is not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "היום בחודש שבו נחתם ההסכם, בכתב יד: [לא קריא] (הקורפוס מתארך אותו 24.11.2010 לפי כותרת הפקס)"

#ASSERT `the 2010 advancement agreement's signed pages were faxed on` `is on or after` `the 2010 advancement agreement was signed in the month of`

-- ¶15: the agreement it amends, signed between the parties on 17.6.09 —
-- the deferral, imported.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the agreement the 2010 advancement amends was signed on` MEANS `the 2009 deferral agreement was signed on`

#ASSERT `the agreement the 2010 advancement amends was signed on` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 17 6 2009

-- ¶16: it was decided that the deferral, carried out to 31.10.2010, has
-- exhausted the teachers' share in the crisis measures. The last day of
-- the deferral, by the parties' own words: §3(א) brings the step forward
-- to the month after it.
@ref akn:preamble/p16
`the deferral exhausted the teachers' share on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 2010

§§ `1 מבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the 2010 advancement agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

@desc A teaching employee and his employer, as far as the agreement of 24.11.2010 asks.
DECLARE `2010 advancement teacher` HAS
    `in the teaching scale, for the 2010 advancement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the State's service, for the 2010 advancement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `his employing body, for the 2010 advancement` IS AN `employing body` @desc as the Budget Foundations Law's sections 21 and 32 tell bodies apart
    `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2010 advancement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "מוסד חינוך" of the Compulsory Education Law section 1 whose budget the government shares, directly or not
    `employed by a funded teacher-training institution, for the 2010 advancement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teacher-training institution whose budget the government shares, directly or not
    `his employer joined the 2010 advancement agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc it added its signature, or told the chief labour-relations officer in writing (annex א's form)

-- (ב) ¶2: "מעסיק ציבורי" is one of four, in the deferral's words: a
-- budgeted body (Budget Foundations Law §21) and a supported body (§32),
-- both imported; an education institution of the Compulsory Education Law
-- that the government funds, and a teacher-training institution it funds —
-- facts of the case (that law is outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN t IS A `2010 advancement teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed by a public employer in the 2010 advancement's sense` t IF
        `is a budgeted body` (t's `his employing body, for the 2010 advancement`)
    OR `is a supported body` (t's `his employing body, for the 2010 advancement`)
    OR t's `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2010 advancement`
    OR t's `employed by a funded teacher-training institution, for the 2010 advancement`

`why the Compulsory Education Law is not in the 2010 advancement` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק לימוד חובה, התש\"ט-1950, סעיף 1"

-- (א): every teaching-scale employee in the State's service ("עובדי
-- הוראה"); (ב): the union consents to its applying to the teaching
-- employees of another public employer that joins it, by signing or by
-- written notice to the chief labour-relations officer.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `2010 advancement teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2010 advancement agreement applies to` t IF
        t's `in the teaching scale, for the 2010 advancement`
    AND (    t's `employed in the State's service, for the 2010 advancement`
         OR (    `employed by a public employer in the 2010 advancement's sense` t
             AND t's `his employer joined the 2010 advancement agreement`))

`joining the 2010 advancement agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `join the 2010 advancement agreement by signing it`

`joining the 2010 advancement agreement by notice` MEANS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `tell the chief labour-relations officer in writing that it joins the 2010 advancement agreement`

-- The form of the notice is annexed as annex א; the scan holds the
-- agreement's two pages and not the annex.
`why the 2010 advancement's notice form is not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "נספח א' להסכם מיום 24.11.2010 (נוסח ההודעה של מעסיק ציבורי המצטרף להסכם): אינו בסריקה"

-- akn:art_2__para_a/p2 The initials at the foot of the first page; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_a/p3 A fax banner; no rule.

§§ `3 קיצור הדחייה של מועד עדכון שכר`

-- (א)(1): in §4(א)(3) of the agreement of 21.2.2008 as the deferral amended
-- it, "the salary of November 2010" for "the salary of October 2011": the
-- completion to 5% comes eleven salary months earlier, the month after
-- the deferral was carried out to (¶16). Before November 2010 the rate is
-- the deferral's, imported.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 24.11.2010` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010)
    THEN 5%
    ELSE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 17.6.2009` d

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 24.11.2010` c IS
    `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 24.11.2010` (c's `the salary month`)

#ASSERT `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 24.11.2010` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2010) EQUALS 3%
#ASSERT `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 24.11.2010` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010) EQUALS 5%
#ASSERT `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 17.6.2009` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010) EQUALS 3%

-- ¶16 and (א)(1) agree: the step comes the day after the deferral's last.
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010) EQUALS (DATE_SERIAL `the deferral exhausted the teachers' share on` PLUS 1)

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the months the 2009 deferral holds back, as amended on 24.11.2010` c IF
        `the salary month is at least` c 2009 12
    AND NOT `the salary month is at least` c 2010 11

-- §4(יא) of 21.2.2008 is read as the deferral's file reads it (finding
-- F-hh-2009-a, convention precedence.specific): in the months the
-- shortened deferral still holds back, the amended rate; in every other
-- month (יא)'s correction to the framework's frame works as before.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 24.11.2010, after §4(יא)` c IS
    IF `in the months the 2009 deferral holds back, as amended on 24.11.2010` c
    THEN `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 24.11.2010` c
    ELSE max (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 24.11.2010` c) (`the 2008 framework cost frame on` (c's `the salary month`))

-- (א)(2): in §35(ב)(1) of the base agreement of 25.12.2008 as the deferral
-- amended it, "1.11.2010" for "1.10.2011" — the update completing the
-- reform tables to 3% over the interim agreement's tables.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_2
`the completing update falls on, as amended on 24.11.2010` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010

#ASSERT `the completing update falls on, as amended on 17.6.2009` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011

-- §35's placeholder cell (100 in the interim tables, 101 annexed) reaches
-- 103 on 1.11.2010, and not before.
`the completing update of the placeholder cell, as amended on 24.11.2010` MEANS
    `table update` WITH
        `from` IS `the completing update falls on, as amended on 24.11.2010`
        `rate` IS `the completing rate for a cell` 100 101

#ASSERT `the cell on` 101 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010) (LIST `the completing update of the placeholder cell, as amended on 24.11.2010`) EQUALS 103
#ASSERT `the cell on` 101 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 2010) (LIST `the completing update of the placeholder cell, as amended on 24.11.2010`) EQUALS 101

-- (ב): no need to change §47's dates (as the deferral amended them),
-- because §47 of 25.12.2008 ("future conversion and placement") applies
-- only to the dates of §4(א)(1) and (2) of 21.2.2008 and not to that of
-- (א)(3): the conversion is done again at the first two dates alone, never
-- at the third, wherever it falls. The deferral's §47 dates, imported, put
-- the third at 1.10.2011; that date and November 2010 are both out.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b
`the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 24.11.2010` MEANS
    take 2 `the dates of §4(א) of the agreement of 21.2.2008`

GIVEN `moved to the reform on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
DECIDE `the dates §47 converts X again at, as amended on 24.11.2010` `moved to the reform on` IS
    filter (GIVEN d YIELD d `is on or after` `moved to the reform on`) `the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 24.11.2010`

#ASSERT `the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 24.11.2010` EQUALS LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008
#ASSERT NOT elem (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011) `the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 24.11.2010`
#ASSERT NOT elem (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2010) `the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 24.11.2010`
#ASSERT elem (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011) `the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 17.6.2009`

-- The example's teacher (moved in September 2007) is converted again at
-- 1.1.2008 and 1.12.2008 only; one who moved in September 2009 is not
-- converted again at all.
#ASSERT `the dates §47 converts X again at, as amended on 24.11.2010` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007) EQUALS LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008
#ASSERT null (`the dates §47 converts X again at, as amended on 24.11.2010` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009))

-- (ב), the rest: "another economic consideration" is given instead of the
-- third conversion — already applied to teaching employees, and subject to
-- its going on being applied. The agreement does not say what it is, what
-- it is worth or by which instrument it is given (finding F-hh-2010-a): a
-- lacuna, not an input.
`the economic consideration given instead of §47's third conversion` MEANS
    `the text is silent` "F-hh-2010-a"

-- F-hh-2010-a's evidence: §47 no longer converts at (א)(3)'s date, and
-- nothing in the agreement says what is given in its place.
`§3(ב) takes out §47's third conversion and names nothing in its place` MEANS
        count `the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 24.11.2010` EQUALS 2
    AND count `the dates of §4(א) of the agreement of 21.2.2008` EQUALS 3
    AND `the economic consideration given instead of §47's third conversion` EQUALS `the text is silent` "F-hh-2010-a"

#ASSERT `§3(ב) takes out §47's third conversion and names nothing in its place`

-- The agreement of 21.2.2008's claim on the 2008 supplement as this
-- agreement amends it: for a teaching employee that agreement covers, from
-- the salary of January 2008; where the case is one of the populations the
-- deferral reached (the shared case's `in a population whose 5% step was
-- put off`), at the rate as shortened here.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 24.11.2010` c IS
    IF `a teaching employee of the agreement of 21.2.2008` c AND `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1
    THEN JUST ((IF c's `in a population whose 5% step was put off`
                THEN `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 24.11.2010, after §4(יא)` c
                ELSE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate after §4(יא)` c)
               TIMES `the base of the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement` c)
    ELSE NOTHING

`the agreement of 24.11.2010` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2010-11-24_teachers_wage-update-advancement"
        `title`         IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 24.11.2010 (הסתדרות המורים)"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS `the 2010 advancement agreement's signed pages were faxed on`
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

§§ `4 מיצוי תביעות`

-- A full and final exhaustion of the parties' claims on the matters this
-- agreement settles, and no further negotiation on them.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN `on a matter this agreement settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2010 advancement agreement exhausts the claim` `on a matter this agreement settled` IF
    `on a matter this agreement settled`

`no further negotiation by the State on the 2010 advancement's matters` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    SHANT `negotiate further on a matter the 2010 advancement agreement settled`

`no further negotiation by the union on the 2010 advancement's matters` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate further on a matter the 2010 advancement agreement settled`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 A filing number ("שכ. 2010-47198"); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p4 A fax banner; no rule.

§§ `examples`

`a teacher of the State in March 2011, put off` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2011
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS TRUE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 300
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`              IS `another school`
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE

-- In March 2011 the deferral as signed held the teacher at 3% (309 on a
-- base of 10,300); as shortened, 5% (515).
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 17.6.2009` `a teacher of the State in March 2011, put off` EQUALS JUST 309
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 24.11.2010` `a teacher of the State in March 2011, put off` EQUALS JUST 515

`a State teacher, for the 2010 advancement` MEANS
    `2010 advancement teacher` WITH
        `in the teaching scale, for the 2010 advancement` IS TRUE
        `employed in the State's service, for the 2010 advancement` IS TRUE
        `his employing body, for the 2010 advancement` IS `the State as an employing body`
        `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2010 advancement` IS FALSE
        `employed by a funded teacher-training institution, for the 2010 advancement` IS FALSE
        `his employer joined the 2010 advancement agreement` IS FALSE

`a local authority's teacher whose employer joined the 2010 advancement` MEANS
    `2010 advancement teacher` WITH
        `in the teaching scale, for the 2010 advancement` IS TRUE
        `employed in the State's service, for the 2010 advancement` IS FALSE
        `his employing body, for the 2010 advancement` IS `a local authority`
        `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2010 advancement` IS FALSE
        `employed by a funded teacher-training institution, for the 2010 advancement` IS FALSE
        `his employer joined the 2010 advancement agreement` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the 2010 advancement agreement applies to` `a State teacher, for the 2010 advancement`
#ASSERT `the 2010 advancement agreement applies to` `a local authority's teacher whose employer joined the 2010 advancement`
